      "body": "@charukeas-t this is a known/documented limitation with the multi-API server.\n\nYou can still use exposed prometheus metrics which will be aggregated correctly.\n\nJust logging these stats from pov of one of the servers will be inconsistent/misleading, especially in DP cases.\n\nCould you try out the new rust frontend? it does not have this limitation, because it doesn't require multiple procs (just set `VLLM_USE_RUST_FRONTEND=1`)\n\n",
